                </div>
                <div>
                    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">Sports Betting Analyzer</h1>
                    <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg mt-1">Machine Learning-Powered Sports Prediction Platform</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-300 text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
